pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$cream"
notes: 概念页（吸引）：年度主题「涨潮时刻」——天文大潮叠加音乐现场，把"峰值时刻"作为招商卖点；随后带出三大舞台定位。
elements:
  # ---- 页眉 ----
  - elementId: header-dot
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 41, 10, 10]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$coral" }
  - elementId: header-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 36, 420, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: 壹 · 年度主题 ANNUAL THEME
  - elementId: header-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [556, 36, 340, 20]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [right, top]
      text: TIDAL FEST 2026 · 招商合作方案
  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 64, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  # ---- 主题阐释 ----
  - elementId: theme-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 92, 400, 62]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 48
      color: "$night"
      letterSpacing: 6
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 涨潮时刻
  - elementId: theme-en
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 160, 320, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$coralDeep"
      letterSpacing: 6
      wrap: false
      text: RISING TIDE
  - elementId: theme-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 198, 420, 100]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12.5
      lineHeight: 1.8
      text: |
        每年七月，澜屿迎来天文大潮。我们把音乐节安放在潮位最高的黄昏——音乐、人群与海浪同时抵达峰值。这就是「涨潮时刻」：一场关于释放与相聚的海边仪式，也是品牌与年轻人同频的最高水位线。
  # 右上日落小景
  - elementId: mini-sun-top
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [806, 92, 72, 72]
    shapeName: pie
    adjustments: [10800000, 21600000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$peach" }
  - elementId: mini-sun-bottom
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [806, 92, 72, 72]
    shapeName: pie
    adjustments: [0, 10800000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$coral" }
  - elementId: mini-wave
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [742, 152, 174, 32]
    shapeName: wave
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$nightDeep" }
    opacity: 0.9

  # ---- 三大舞台卡片 ----
  - elementId: c1-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 320, 264, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$coral" }
  - elementId: c1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 324, 264, 176]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 0.75, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: c1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 338, 60, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$coral"
      wrap: false
      text: "01"
  - elementId: c1-name
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 372, 224, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 17
      color: "$night"
      wrap: false
      text: 潮声主舞台
  - elementId: c1-en
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 400, 224, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      letterSpacing: 2
      wrap: false
      text: TIDE MAIN STAGE
  - elementId: c1-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 424, 224, 42]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11.5
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: 压轴级乐队与唱作人主场，两天四组头部阵容，全场合唱发生地。
  - elementId: c1-time
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 474, 224, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 10.5
      bold: true
      color: "$nightDeep"
      text: 每日 19:00 – 22:30

  - elementId: c2-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [348, 320, 264, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$nightDeep" }
  - elementId: c2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [348, 324, 264, 176]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 0.75, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: c2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [368, 338, 60, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$nightDeep"
      wrap: false
      text: "02"
  - elementId: c2-name
    elementType: text
    bounds: [368, 372, 224, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 17
      color: "$night"
      wrap: false
      text: 落日电子舞台
  - elementId: c2-en
    elementType: text
    bounds: [368, 400, 224, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      letterSpacing: 2
      wrap: false
      text: SUNSET ELECTRONIC STAGE
  - elementId: c2-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [368, 424, 224, 42]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11.5
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: 日落时分开启的电子现场，DJ 演出与海面光影秀同步进行。
  - elementId: c2-time
    elementType: text
    bounds: [368, 474, 224, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 10.5
      bold: true
      color: "$nightDeep"
      text: 每日 17:00 – 21:00

  - elementId: c3-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [632, 320, 264, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$peach" }
  - elementId: c3-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [632, 324, 264, 176]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 0.75, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: c3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [652, 338, 60, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$coralDeep"
      wrap: false
      text: "03"
  - elementId: c3-name
    elementType: text
    bounds: [652, 372, 224, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou"
      fontSize: 17
      color: "$night"
      wrap: false
      text: 浪花新声舞台
  - elementId: c3-en
    elementType: text
    bounds: [652, 400, 224, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      letterSpacing: 2
      wrap: false
      text: WAVE NEW VOICE STAGE
  - elementId: c3-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [652, 424, 224, 42]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11.5
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: 新血乐队与校园唱作人竞演舞台，发现下一个浪头。
  - elementId: c3-time
    elementType: text
    bounds: [652, 474, 224, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 10.5
      bold: true
      color: "$nightDeep"
      text: 每日 15:00 – 19:00

  # ---- 页脚 ----
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 512, 340, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: 潮汐音乐节 TIDAL FEST 2026
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [856, 512, 40, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, top]
      text: 02 / 07
